  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "罗雀咖啡馆。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7F5796C0549655619986300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "正如其名，\n咖啡馆还是门可罗雀比较好。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B6359825176540DFF0C000A5496556199868FD8662F95E853EF7F5796C06BD48F83597D300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这家咖啡馆以前也因为客人太多，\n超出了负荷……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD95BB65496556199864EE5524D4E5F56E04E3A5BA24EBA592A591AFF0C000A8D8551FA4E868D1F83772026202600100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "人一旦太忙，内心就会枯竭，\n我不喜欢这样……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EBA4E0065E6592A5FD9FF0C51855FC35C314F1A67AF7AEDFF0C000A62114E0D559C6B228FD968372026202600100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "话虽如此，客人不上门店就会倒闭。\n这个分寸太难拿捏了……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BDD867D59826B64FF0C5BA24EBA4E0D4E0A95E85E975C314F1A501295ED3002000A8FD94E2A52065BF8592A96BE62FF634F4E862026202600100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你懂我的意思了吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6061C262117684610F601D4E865427FF1F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "完全不懂",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B8C51684E0D61C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我可没有超能力",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EF6CA167098D8580FD529B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "简单来说，客人上门的数量最好\n既不会让店倒闭，又不会让我太忙。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我希望研发出能达到这种平衡的餐点。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B80535567658BF4FF0C5BA24EBA4E0A95E87684657091CF6700597D000A65E24E0D4F1A8BA95E97501295EDFF0C53C84E0D4F1A8BA96211592A5FD9300200100001BE00000A62115E0C671B781453D151FA80FD8FBE52308FD979CD5E7388617684991070B9300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什么样的餐点比较好呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC04E4868377684991070B96BD48F83597D5462FF1F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷格雷派饼",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E997C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可颂",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF98820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咖喱饭",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "549655B1996D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷格雷派饼无论在哪卖\n都只是密阿雷格雷派饼，我不喜欢这样。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E997C65E08BBA572854EA5356000A90FD53EA662F5BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E997CFF0C62114E0D559C6B228FD96837300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "比不过新咖啡的可颂，\n我不喜欢这样。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD44E0D8FC765B054965561768453EF9882FF0C000A62114E0D559C6B228FD96837300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "旅馆Z的咖喱好吃得出乎意料，\n要被拿来比较，我不喜欢这样。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65C59986005A7684549655B1597D54035F9751FA4E4E610F6599FF0C000A898188AB62FF67656BD48F83FF0C62114E0D559C6B228FD96837300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寿司……你觉得如何？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BFF53F8202620264F6089C95F9759824F55FF1F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它刚好既是简餐，\n又和咖啡不搭……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也就是说，它能吸引一定数量的顾客上门。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B83521A597D65E2662F7B809910FF0C000A53C8548C549655614E0D642D2026202600100001BE00000A4E5F5C31662F8BF4FF0C5B8380FD54385F154E005B9A657091CF7684987E5BA24E0A95E8300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不得不说我这主意真棒！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D5F974E0D8BF462118FD94E3B610F771F68D2FF0100100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但我从来没有做过寿司。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4662114ECE67656CA16709505A8FC75BFF53F8300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而在回转梦想家吃的话\n又太花钱，我不喜欢这样！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n现在你懂我的意思了吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C572856DE8F6C68A660F35BB6540376848BDD000A53C8592A82B194B1FF0C62114E0D559C6B228FD96837FF0100100001BE00000A73B057284F6061C262117684610F601D4E865427FF1F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我觉得你不懂，所以直说好了，\n给我看看米立龙吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n而且3种姿势我都要看！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189C95F974F604E0D61C2FF0C62404EE576F48BF4597D4E86FF0C000A7ED96211770B770B7C737ACB9F995427300200100001BE00000A800C4E14003379CD59FF52BF621190FD8981770BFF0100100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
