      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D7ED96211770B621163075B9A76847C737ACB9F99FF0C000A62114E0D559C6B228FD96837300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
