      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会凭大概的感觉试着做寿司，\n请你稍等一下。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A51ED592769827684611F89C98BD57740505A5BFF53F8FF0C000A8BF74F607A0D7B494E004E0B300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你觉得怎么样？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n虽然一看就知道是外行做的，\n但还是会让人在意，所以想点点看。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
