    },
    {
      "displayText": "真不愧是密阿雷，\n对美食充满渴望的城市！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F4E0D6127662F5BC6963F96F7FF0C000A5BF97F8E98DF51456EE16E34671B768457CE5E02FF0100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我还没吃……\n但这必须得推荐给全世界才行！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713662118FD86CA1540320262026000A4F468FD95FC5987B5F9763A883507ED951684E16754C624D884CFF0100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是芭奥红，\n在密阿雷遇到了不得了的东西！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F82AD59657EA2FF0C000A57285BC6963F96F7904752304E864E0D5F974E8676844E1C897FFF0100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寿司＆咖啡将打开新世界！\n你也快来罗雀咖啡馆吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BFF53F8FF06549655615C0662535F0065B04E16754CFF01000A4F604E5F5FEB67657F5796C05496556199865427FF0100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀～！又不小心发出去了，\n又影响到全世界啦～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF5EFF0153C84E0D5C0F5FC353D151FA53BB4E86FF0C000A53C85F7154CD523051684E16754C5566FF5E00100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就是这里。\n刚才那个寿司＆咖啡的名店！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31662F8FD991CC3002000A521A624D90A34E2A5BFF53F8FF06549655617684540D5E97FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请给我寿司＆咖啡！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77ED962115BFF53F8FF0654965561FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寿司＆咖啡，\n简称为寿司咖，来一份！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BFF53F8FF0654965561FF0C000A7B8079F04E3A5BFF53F85496FF0C67654E004EFDFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦～！？\n太忙了，我不喜欢这样！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF5EFF01FF1F000A592A5FD94E86FF0C62114E0D559C6B228FD96837FF01FF0100100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
